title: "ftir-thz: Process and analyse FTIR spectra"
type: software
version: 0.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Tao
    given-names: Yu Heng
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8028-5023"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Desktop application for processing terahertz FTIR spectra: difference
  absorbance and absorption coefficient of sample/reference pairs, water vapour
  and etalon fringe removal, bulk solvent removal, singular value decomposition
  and multivariate curve resolution.
